417
00:34:21,621 --> 00:34:25,621
思い出の中君の姿
In my memories, your figure...

418
00:34:25,621 --> 00:34:28,621
夢のまま 覚めないまま
Remaining in a dream, never waking up...

419
00:34:28,621 --> 00:34:32,621
変わらないな
It remains unchanged.

420
00:34:35,921 --> 00:34:40,621
思い出の中にはいつも君の姿
In my memories, your figure is always there.

421
00:34:40,621 --> 00:34:47,621
夢のまま 覚めないまま その笑顔が忘れられないや
Remaining in a dream, never waking up, I can't forget that smile.

